sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Inv as Investor
    participant UI as Next.js (/investor)
    participant Auth as Auth & KYC
    participant IC as InvestorsController
    participant IMC as InvestorMatchesController
    participant IS as InvestorService
    participant DS as DiligenceService
    participant PS as PortfolioService
    participant DC as DealsController
    participant DB as MongoDB Collections

    Note over Inv,DB: Phase 1: Onboarding & Accreditation
    Inv->>UI: Register / Switch to Investor Persona
    UI->>IC: POST /api/investor/profile
    IC->>DB: Read/Write Investors collection
    UI->>Auth: KYC / Sumsub Flow (IdentityController)
    Auth->>DB: Update UniversalIdentityVerifications

    Note over Inv,DB: Phase 2: Thesis & Discovery
    Inv->>UI: Define Thesis & Investment Preferences
    UI->>IC: PUT /api/investor/preferences
    IC->>DB: Update Investors (Ticket size, stages, industries)
    UI->>IMC: GET /api/investormatches
    IMC->>IS: FindMatches(investorId)
    IS->>DB: Query Companies & CreatorIdeas
    IS->>DB: Write InvestorMatches cache

    Note over Inv,DB: Phase 3: Diligence & Data Room
    Inv->>UI: Request Data Room Access / Start Diligence
    UI->>IC: POST /api/investor/diligence/request
    IC->>DS: InitiateDiligenceSession(companyId, investorId)
    DS->>DB: Read Companies (DataRoom, Financials, CapTable)
    DS->>DB: Write DiligenceSessions

    Note over Inv,DB: Phase 4: Deal Formation & Term Sheet
    Inv->>UI: Propose Term Sheet / Investment Deal
    UI->>DC: POST /api/deals (DealType: Investment)
    DC->>DB: Read Company CapTable & Founder data
    DC->>DB: Create Deals record (Status: Draft)
    DC->>UI: Return DealId & Term Sheet

    Note over Inv,DB: Phase 5: Closing, Escrow & Holdings
    Inv->>DC: POST /api/deals/{id}/execute
    DC->>DB: Update Deals (Status: Executed)
    DC->>PS: CreateHolding(investorId, companyId, shares, amount)
    PS->>DB: Write Holdings / Investments collection
    PS->>DB: Mutate Companies.CapTable (Dilution update)
